Package: emputation
Type: Package
Title: Identification-Guided Neural Imputation Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yanjiao", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "yjyang00@uw.edu"),
    person("Yikun", "Zhang", role = "aut"),
    person("Xinwei", "Shen", role = "aut"),
    person("Yen-Chi", "Chen", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Emputation is a deep generative framework for learning imputation 
    models. The emputation risk, is an energy-score-based risk function in which 
    a chosen missing-data identification assumption (e.g. MCAR, complete-case 
    missing variable / CCMV, or tree graph) guides training. 
